desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "检测到 MCP 配置硬编码密钥"
	title_zh: "检测到 MCP 配置硬编码密钥",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-config-mcp-hardcoded-config-secret-generic"
	risk: "hardcoded-credentials"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
该规则用于检测 MCP 配置硬编码密钥 相关的风险模式，属于 硬编码凭据 类问题。

### 风险类型
硬编码凭据（hardcoded-credentials）

### 影响
代码中直接写入账号、令牌等敏感凭据，泄露后攻击者可直接使用这些凭据访问系统或服务。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-798
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除硬编码凭据，改用环境变量、密钥管理服务或安全配置中心，并立即轮换已泄露的凭据。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://posmcpx.json": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-config-mcp-hardcoded-config-secret-generic
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*mcp*.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-[a-zA-Z0-9]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p0
${*mcp*.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-ant-[a-zA-Z0-9\-]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p1
${*mcp*.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-proj-[a-zA-Z0-9\-]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p2
${*mcp*.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"hf_[a-zA-Z0-9]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p3
${*mcp*.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"AIza[a-zA-Z0-9\-_]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p4
${claude_desktop_config.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-[a-zA-Z0-9]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p5
${claude_desktop_config.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-ant-[a-zA-Z0-9\-]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p6
${claude_desktop_config.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"sk-proj-[a-zA-Z0-9\-]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p7
${claude_desktop_config.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"hf_[a-zA-Z0-9]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p8
${claude_desktop_config.json}.pattern_regex(/(?::\s*"AIza[a-zA-Z0-9\-_]{20,}")|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-config\-mcp\-hardcoded\-config\-secret\-generic/) as $p9
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 + $p4 + $p5 + $p6 + $p7 + $p8 + $p9 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 MCP 配置硬编码密钥",
	title_zh: "检测到 MCP 配置硬编码密钥",
	message: "检测到 MCP 配置硬编码密钥",
}
